# Worker app env for **loopback** (`npm run dev`, two-tab spike) and
# leftover `npm run secrets:push`. Production Google / session /
# CRANE_BEARERS live in **Gantree Settings → Pendant** — do not also
# bulk-put from here once the yard owns them.
#
# Cloudflare *account* credentials are GitHub secrets (CI) or
# `npx wrangler login` (laptop). Worker *code* deploy is this repo.
# See docs/deployment.md.

# Spike (two browser tabs). Never pushed. Gone once Google + crane bearers are set.
MAILBOX_SECRET=

# Loopback-only mock mouth (`npm run dev`). Never set on workers.dev.
# PENDANT_DEV=1

# Leftover — prefer Gantree Settings → Pendant for workers.dev.
# New Web application client. Scopes: openid email profile only.
# Redirect: https://<this-origin>/api/auth/callback/google
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
SESSION_SECRET=

# Optional yard-wide extra. The crane list is the door.
# ALLOWED_SUBS=1182…:ada@example.com,1183…:kit@example.com
ALLOWED_SUBS=

# Leftover crane bearers for secrets:push. Gantree Build mints these.
# CRANE_BEARER_kit=
# CRANE_BEARER_ada=
# CRANE_BEARERS=kit:<random>,ada:<random>

# Lock-screen Web Push (optional). Mint with `npm run vapid`.
# Gantree Settings does not push these yet — wrangler secret put, or leftover secrets:push.
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=https://github.com/shotah/gantry-pendant

# Optional. Pin Kit's Durable Object near the Mini (first get() wins).
# wnam enam sam weur eeur apac oc afr me apac-ne apac-se
# LOCATION_HINT=wnam
